msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga! Kitamura!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Taiga! ¡Kitamura!」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Ryuuji?!」"

msgid "Kitamura「............」"
msgstr "Kitamura「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, you had me running in circles,＿dammit...... I looked all over for you!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga, me hiciste dar vueltas＿como loco, maldición...... ¡Te＿busqué por todas partes!」"

msgid "Taiga「I have no business with you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No tengo ningún asunto contigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I have business with YOU!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Yo sí tengo un asunto CONTIGO!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Then why don't you come out with it?＿Right here, right now.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Entonces por qué no lo dices?＿Aquí mismo, ahora mismo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......!」"

msgid "Kitamura「As you can see, I was talking to her＿first. If it's urgent, kindly get it over＿with.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Como puedes ver, yo estaba hablando＿con ella primero. Si es urgente, ten＿la amabilidad de acabar pronto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......It is.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Lo es.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Kitamura「No, you can stay and watch if you're＿curious.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No, puedes quedarte a mirar＿si tienes curiosidad.」"

msgid "Kitamura「I think it's fair to let you hear it. In＿exchange, kindly don't interrupt me.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Creo que es justo dejar que lo oigas. A＿cambio, por favor no me interrumpas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Kitamura「Aisaka, I'm sorry about the other day.＿Breaking up your fight was＿presumptuous of me.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Aisaka, siento lo del otro＿día. Fue presuntuoso de mi＿parte detener su pelea.」"

msgid "Taiga「It's fine...... If you hadn't shown up then,＿I think I would have done something＿even more awful to Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No pasa nada...... Si no hubieras＿aparecido entonces, creo que le habría＿hecho algo aún peor a Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Do you remember what you told me at＿the planetarium?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Recuerdas lo que me dijiste＿en el planetario?」"

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Kitamura「You trusted me enough to talk to me＿about it, right?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Confiaste en mí lo suficiente como＿para contármelo, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Taiga「W-What are you talking about?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿D-De qué estás hablando?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Aisaka, I......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Aisaka, yo......」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Kitamura「*Sigh*...... I'm amazed, Takasu. Are you＿really just going to stand there and＿watch?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「*Suspiro*...... Me sorprendes,＿Takasu. ¿De verdad te vas a quedar＿ahí parado mirando?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Watch what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿M-Mirar qué?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Good grief. You're slow despite your＿glare and cowardly despite your face.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Santo cielo. Eres lento pese a tu＿mirada y cobarde pese a tu cara.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Why did you come here? To observe＿my confession? Of course not.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Para qué viniste aquí? ¿A presenciar＿mi declaración? Claro que no.」"

msgid "Kitamura「If you're a man, why don't you take＿what you want by force......? Like this!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Si eres hombre, ¿por qué no tomas lo que＿quieres a la fuerza......? ¡Así!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nggh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nggh......」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji! K-Kitamura-kun! What the hell＿are you doing......!? Ugh!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ryuuji! ¡K-Kitamura-kun! ¡¿Qué demonios＿están haciendo......?! ¡Agh!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Taiga!」"

msgid "Taiga「T-That hurts! What are you doing!? Let＿go!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡M-Me duele! ¡¿Qué haces?! ¡Suéltame!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Ha ha ha, you're feisty as always.＿That's something else I've always liked＿about you.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ja, ja, ja, tan brava como siempre.＿Eso es otra cosa que siempre＿me gustó de ti.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura, what is wrong with you......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kitamura, ¿qué te pasa......?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Nothing's wrong in the least. I want＿Aisaka, so I'm taking her by force.＿That's all this is.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No me pasa nada en absoluto. Quiero＿a Aisaka, así que la tomo a la＿fuerza. Eso es todo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Now, what will you do? Wanna take me＿on?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Y bien, ¿qué vas a hacer?＿¿Quieres enfrentarme?」"

msgid "Sorry, violence solves nothing"
msgstr "Lo siento, la violencia no resuelve nada"

msgid "Fight with the weapon from Taiga"
msgstr "Pelear con el arma que me dio Taiga"

msgid "Separate them somehow"
msgstr "Separarlos de algún modo"

msgid "Ryuuji「I...... I'm sorry, but violence solves＿nothing.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo...... Lo siento, pero la violencia＿no resuelve nada.」"

msgid "Kitamura「............」"
msgstr "Kitamura「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Here's the deal.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Hagamos esto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura, let go of Taiga's hand. If you＿say no...... I have my own proposition.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kitamura, suelta la mano de＿Taiga. Si te niegas...... tengo＿mi propia propuesta.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Proposition? Great, let's see it.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Propuesta? Genial, veámosla.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'll make you regret it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Haré que te arrepientas.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Just what I wanted.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Justo lo que quería.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now you've done it. Wait right there,＿got it!? Don't take a single step!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ahora sí te la ganaste. ¡Espera ahí,＿¿entendido?! ¡No des ni un solo paso!」"

msgid "Kitamura「\"Wait right there\"......? Takasu, where＿are you going!?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿\"Espera ahí\"......? ¡¿Takasu,＿adónde vas?!」"

msgid "Taiga「......I have a REALLY bad feeling about＿this.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Tengo un MUY mal presentimiento＿sobre esto.」"

msgid "Kitamura「......!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......!」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, that's......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji, eso es......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, this is the wooden sword you gave＿me. It's finally come in handy.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, es la espada de madera que me＿diste. Por fin sirvió de algo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「JUST SHUT UP AND WATCH!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡TÚ SOLO CÁLLATE Y MIRA!」"

msgid "Taiga「......!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「After everything that's been said,＿there's no way I can back down.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Después de todo lo que se ha dicho,＿no hay forma de que me eche atrás.」"

msgid "Kitamura「That's great. You don't want to lose a＿battle of strength, huh? It'll be more＿challenging with a handicap in place.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Estupendo. No quieres perder un duelo＿de fuerza, ¿eh? Será más desafiante＿con esta desventaja.」"

msgid "Kitamura「............」"
msgstr "Kitamura「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Kitamura「What's wrong? All bark and no bite?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Qué pasa? ¿Mucho ruido y pocas nueces?」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I'll aim at a single point...... and decide＿this with a single blow.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Apuntaré a un solo punto...... y＿lo decidiré de un solo golpe.）」"

msgid "Kitamura「If you're too chicken, then I'll go first,＿Takasu!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Si eres muy gallina, entonces＿iré yo primero, ¡Takasu!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Now!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......¡Ahora!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「TAKE THIIIS!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡TOMA ESTOOO!」"

msgid "Kitamura「What--!?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡¿Qué--?!」"

msgid "Taiga「......!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......!」"

msgid "Kitamura「T-That was cheap, Takasu!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡E-Eso fue un golpe bajo, Takasu!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Tell someone who cares! Taiga, come＿here!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Cuéntaselo a quien le importe!＿¡Taiga, ven acá!」"

msgid "Taiga「What!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Qué?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I said come here!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Dije que vengas acá!」"

msgid "Taiga「Wha......!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Qué......!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Wait! ......Shit, where are my glasses!?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Espera! ......¡Mierda, ¿dónde＿están mis lentes?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Pulling Taiga by the hand, I just ran＿and ran like my life depended on it......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tirando de la mano de Taiga,＿corrí y corrí como si me fuera＿la vida en ello......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「All I could think of was to get Taiga＿away from Kitamura as fast as＿possible.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Lo único en que pensaba era＿en alejar a Taiga de Kitamura＿lo más rápido posible.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, are you okay?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga, ¿estás bien?」"

msgid "Taiga「You...... Damn you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tú...... Maldito seas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Excuse me!? He was twisting your arm!＿Isn't it a little late to be worried about＿him!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Perdón?! ¡Te torcía el brazo! ¡¿No es＿un poco tarde para preocuparte por él?!」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm asking you what you'd do if you'd＿gotten suspended or expelled over a＿stupid thing like this!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Te pregunto qué harías si te hubieran＿suspendido o expulsado por una＿tontería como esta!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's not stupid!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No es una tontería!」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「My body just moved on its own. I＿couldn't help it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mi cuerpo se movió solo.＿No pude evitarlo.」"

msgid "Taiga「......My hand.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Mi mano.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mm?」"

msgid "Taiga「Let go of my hand.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Suéltame la mano.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Oh, yeah, sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? Ah, sí, perdón.」"

msgid "Taiga「......You're really stupid, dull,＿impulsive...... and hopeless.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......De verdad eres tonto, torpe,＿impulsivo...... y un caso perdido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「P-Perdón.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Err...... T-Taiga, umm......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehm...... T-Taiga, eh......」"

msgid "Kitamura「So this is where you two were.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Así que aquí estaban los dos.」"

msgid "Both「......!」"
msgstr "Ambos「......!」"

msgid "Kitamura「I can't believe I let my guard down＿earlier.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No puedo creer que bajara＿la guardia hace rato.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're so persistent!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Qué terco eres!」"

msgid "Taiga「Cut it out, you guys......!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ya basta, ustedes dos......!」"

msgid "Sumire「Stop right there!」"
msgstr "Sumire「¡Alto ahí!」"

msgid "Sumire「Takasu, put down the sword.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Takasu, baja la espada.」"

msgid "Taiga「Y-You!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡T-Tú!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kanou-senpai!? Didn't you go back to＿America!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Kanou-senpai?! ¡¿No habías＿vuelto a Estados Unidos?!」"

msgid "Sumire「You've gone too far, Kitamura. You got＿fuckin' carried away.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Te pasaste de la raya, Kitamura.＿Demonios, te dejaste llevar.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Fu...... fufufu, ah ha ha!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ju...... jujuju, ¡ja, ja, ja!」"

msgid "Kitamura「......I'm sorry, Prez. I was just enjoying＿myself.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......Perdón, Presidenta. Solo＿me estaba divirtiendo.」"

msgid "Sumire「That was quite the scuffle, Takasu. I＿wouldn't give it full marks, but a＿passing grade, at least.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Menuda trifulca, Takasu. No＿te daría nota perfecta, pero＿al menos sí un aprobado.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Beg your pardon?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Disculpa?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Man, I must have an evil streak. Well?＿Was I convincing, Takasu? Not bad,＿right?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Vaya, debo tener una vena malvada.＿¿Y? ¿Fui convincente, Takasu?＿Nada mal, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"Convincing\"......? Taiga, did you know＿about this!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿\"Convincente\"......? Taiga,＿¡¿tú sabías de esto?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Hell no I didn't!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Claro que no!」"

msgid "Taiga「I thought Kitamura-kun was acting＿weird...... But I never would have＿thought he'd hit Ryuuji!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Pensé que Kitamura-kun andaba raro......＿¡Pero nunca habría imaginado que＿golpearía a Ryuuji!」"

msgid "Kitamura「I admit I went overboard.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Admito que me excedí.」"

msgid "Kitamura「However, I wasn't just pretending to be＿deeply disgusted by that \"stand and＿watch\" behavior of yours.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Sin embargo, no estaba fingiendo el＿profundo disgusto por esa actitud＿tuya de \"quedarte mirando\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Kitamura「That said, I apologize for hitting you,＿Takasu. Hit me back and then we can＿put this all behind us.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Dicho esto, me disculpo por golpearte,＿Takasu. Devuélveme el golpe y dejemos＿todo esto atrás.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I can't do that. What you said was＿right......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No puedo hacer eso. Lo que＿dijiste era verdad......」"

msgid "Kitamura「What, you're going to just let this＿linger over me? You're awful.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Qué, vas a dejar que cargue＿con esto? Eres terrible.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno......」"

msgid "Kitamura「......!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, what did YOU hit him for!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga, ¡¿y TÚ por qué lo golpeaste?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Now we're even.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ahora estamos a mano.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm a victim too, after all. Feel better?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Yo también soy víctima, después＿de todo. ¿Te sientes mejor?」"

msgid "Kitamura「......Yeah. I feel great, Aisaka.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......Sí. Me siento genial, Aisaka.」"

msgid "Sumire「Alright, it's over. I, Kanou Sumire, was＿the witness for this fight. Now, let＿bygones be bygones.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Bien, se acabó. Yo, Kanou Sumire,＿fui testigo de esta pelea. Ahora,＿lo pasado, pisado.」"

msgid "Sumire「So, Kitamura. Did you tell Aisaka＿everything you needed to?」"
msgstr "Sumire「Y bien, Kitamura. ¿Le dijiste a Aisaka＿todo lo que tenías que decirle?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Oops, sorry. I nearly forgot.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Uy, perdón. Casi se me olvida.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Forgot what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Olvidar qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......WHAT?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿QUÉ?」"

msgid "Taiga「Like on a committee?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Como en un comité?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Well, yeah. With your strong will and＿perseverance, we're sure to have an＿awesome party! Right, Prez?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Pues sí. Con tu voluntad y＿perseverancia, ¡seguro tendremos＿una fiesta increíble! ¿Verdad?」"

msgid "Sumire「Yeah, no doubt.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Sí, sin duda.」"

msgid "Taiga「......You tricked us!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¡¿Nos engañaron?!」"

msgid "Sumire「You guys totally fell for it. Hahaha!」"
msgstr "Sumire「Cayeron redonditos. ¡Jajaja!」"

msgid "Taiga「Tch......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tch......」"

msgid "Kitamura「We've exacted our revenge, Prez. It's＿almost time.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ya tuvimos nuestra venganza, Presidenta.＿Ya casi es hora.」"

msgid "Sumire「Yeah, you're right. This little act of＿yours took quite some time.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Sí, tienes razón. Este teatrito＿tuyo tomó bastante tiempo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「I'll reflect on how I got carried away......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Reflexionaré sobre cómo＿me dejé llevar......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Senpai, where are you going now?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Senpai, ¿adónde vas ahora?」"

msgid "Sumire「I told you, back to America. I wasn't＿kidding. If I don't head for the airport＿soon, I really will miss my flight.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Ya te dije, de vuelta a Estados Unidos.＿No bromeaba. Si no voy pronto al＿aeropuerto, sí perderé mi vuelo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Well then, I'll see you off there.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Bueno, entonces te despediré allá.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo.」"

msgid "Sumire「Takasu, Aisaka, see ya.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Takasu, Aisaka, nos vemos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Senpai!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Senpai!」"

msgid "Sumire「Hm?」"
msgstr "Sumire「¿Mm?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Thank you...... for everything.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Gracias...... por todo.」"

msgid "Sumire「Right back at you. Kick some ass.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Lo mismo digo. ¡Arrasa!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"Kick some ass\"......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「\"Arrasa\"......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Taiga「What's that look for! It's a bodily＿function. I can't help that my stomach＿growls when I'm tired!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Y esa cara qué! Es una función＿corporal. ¡No puedo evitar que me ruja＿el estómago cuando estoy cansada!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, whatever. I was going to give this＿to you anyway.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, como sea. De todos＿modos iba a darte esto.」"

msgid "Taiga「What is it? A boxed lunch! Why didn't＿you give it to me sooner?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué es? ¡Un almuerzo! ¿Por＿qué no me lo diste antes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I was going to give it to you in the＿classroom, but you ran off. I bet your＿diet's gone to shit these days.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Iba a dártelo en el salón, pero saliste＿corriendo. Seguro que tu dieta es＿una mierda estos días.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'll decide whether it's \"shit\" or not.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Yo decidiré si es \"mierda\" o no.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Sheesh...... Wait, why are you＿opening it here of all places!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Cielos...... Espera, ¡¿por qué＿lo abres precisamente aquí?!」"

msgid "Taiga「It's sunny today, so I'll eat outside. No＿big deal.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Hoy hace sol, así que comeré＿afuera. No es gran cosa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're THAT hungry, huh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「TANTA hambre tienes, ¿eh......?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yum!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ñam!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You sound like Inko-chan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Suenas como Inko-chan.」"

msgid "Taiga「Did you say something?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Dijiste algo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's nothing...... Hey Taiga, can I ask you＿something?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No es nada...... Oye, Taiga,＿¿puedo preguntarte algo?」"

msgid "Taiga「What is it?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What did you tell Kitamura at the＿planetarium?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué le dijiste a Kitamura＿en el planetario?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Not telling.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......No te digo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just be straightforward for once!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Sé directa por una vez!」"

msgid "Taiga「No matter what you may have heard,＿I'm absolutely not telling. You're not＿fully you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No importa lo que hayas oído,＿no te lo voy a decir ni loca.＿No eres tú del todo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What do you mean, I'm not fully me? Of＿course I'm me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cómo que no soy yo del todo?＿Claro que soy yo.」"

msgid "Taiga「There are still memories you need to＿get back, Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Todavía hay recuerdos que necesitas＿recuperar, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Memories I need......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Recuerdos que necesito......?」"

msgid "Taiga「You have a crush on someone. A＿hopeless, one-sided crush.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Estás enamorado de alguien. Un amor＿imposible y no correspondido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Ah?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Taiga「Remind you of anything?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Te recuerda algo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Not right now...... Even so, that's a thing＿of the past.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Por ahora no...... Aun así,＿eso es cosa del pasado.」"

msgid "Taiga「No it's not.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No lo es.」"

msgid "Taiga「Once you get your memory back, we'll＿tell everyone, and then we'll all be＿completely equal.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cuando recuperes la memoria, se＿lo diremos a todos, y estaremos＿en igualdad de condiciones.」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, I think you'll make a beeline for＿your crush, anyway.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, igual creo que irás directo＿tras la persona que te gusta.」"

msgid "Taiga「If you still feel the same after that, I'll＿tell you what I discussed with＿Kitamura-kun at the planetarium.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si sigues sintiendo lo mismo después＿de eso, te diré de qué hablé con＿Kitamura-kun en el planetario.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......This is kinda hard to understand.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Esto es algo difícil de entender.」"

msgid "Taiga「Until then, I'll continue to be the owner＿of a mongrel, same as always. I'd feel＿guilty if I got rid of my dog.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Hasta entonces, seré dueña de un perro,＿como siempre. Me sentiría culpable si＿me deshiciera de mi perro.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Can you just stop treating me like a＿dog already?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Puedes dejar de tratarme como＿a un perro de una vez?」"

msgid "Taiga「You're the one who said you wanted to＿be my little helper dog.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tú fuiste el que dijo que quería＿ser mi perrito ayudante.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You've embroidered that quite＿conveniently for yourself.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Adornaste esa historia bastante＿a tu conveniencia.」"

msgid "Taiga「So, I know it's early, but what's for＿dinner?」"
msgstr "Taiga「En fin, sé que es temprano,＿pero ¿qué hay para cenar?」"

msgid "Taiga「That's my Yacchan! Let's see, definitely＿chili shrimp, meatballs, fried rice with＿gravy......」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Esa es mi Yacchan! A ver, sin duda＿camarones al chile, albóndigas, arroz＿frito con salsa......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, and we need to put radishes on the＿menu.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, y tenemos que poner＿rábanos en el menú.」"

msgid "Taiga「Radishes? Why!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Rábanos? ¡¿Por qué?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「――Before long, my only company was＿an emptied lunchbox and an＿unsuspecting sleeping face.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「――Al poco tiempo, mi única compañía＿era una caja de almuerzo vacía y un＿rostro dormido sin preocupación.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This. This is all I need. If only it could＿stay this way.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Esto. Esto es todo lo que necesito.＿Ojalá pudiera quedarse así.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm sure this relationship is built over a＿very fragile balance. It's like I'm＿walking on thin ice.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Seguro esta relación se sostiene sobre＿un equilibrio muy frágil. Es como si＿caminara sobre hielo delgado.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's no longer a nightmare to me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya no es una pesadilla para mí.」"

msgid "Yuri「Hello. First of all, perhaps I should＿thank you for your hard work,＿Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Hola. Antes que nada, quizá＿debería agradecerte por tu arduo＿trabajo, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Now that you got this ending, the＿reason I brought you here......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ahora que obtuviste este final, la razón＿por la que te traje aquí......」"

msgid "Yuri「......is none other than to discuss the＿route you chose. I thought we could＿ponder it together.」"
msgstr "Yuri「......no es otra que hablar sobre＿tu ruta. Pensé que podríamos＿reflexionar juntos.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's evaluate the ending you＿just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, evaluemos el final＿que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「Welcome, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bienvenido, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's begin to evaluate the＿ending you just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, empecemos a evaluar el＿final que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「I see...... This time you chose＿Aisaka-san in the end.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ya veo...... Esta vez elegiste＿a Aisaka-san al final.」"

msgid "Yuri「So I'll save my congratulations for that＿day.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Así que guardaré mis felicitaciones＿para ese día.」"

msgid "Yuri「Now then. If I were to grade this＿ending, I guess I'd give it 75 points.＿You worked hard!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ahora bien. Si tuviera que calificar＿este final, supongo que le daría 75＿puntos. ¡Te esforzaste mucho!」"

msgid "Yuri「Okay, that's all for today. Until next＿time!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bueno, eso es todo por hoy.＿¡Hasta la próxima!」"

msgid "『Music』 is now available in 『Extra』"
msgstr "『Música』 ya está disponible en 『Extra』"

msgid "『Album』 is now available in 『Extra』"
msgstr "『Álbum』 ya está disponible en 『Extra』"

msgid "Ryuuji「I came here because I have business＿with you, Taiga. Not for a fistfight with＿Kitamura.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vine porque tengo un asunto＿contigo, Taiga. No para pelear＿a golpes con Kitamura.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, I......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga, yo......」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, I......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Taiga, yo......!」"

msgid "Taiga「Kitamura-kun!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Kitamura-kun!」"

msgid "Taiga「......I have feelings for Kitamura-kun.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Siento algo por Kitamura-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué......」"

msgid "Kitamura「But Aisaka, you like......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Pero Aisaka, a ti te gusta......」"

msgid "Taiga「I. Like. Kitamura-kun.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Me. Gusta. Kitamura-kun.」"

msgid "Kitamura「............」"
msgstr "Kitamura「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Tai... ga...」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tai... ga...」"

msgid "Taiga「What's with that derpy dog-face,＿Ryuuji? What are you doing,＿eavesdropping on a confession?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Y esa cara de perro tonto, Ryuuji? ¿Qué＿haces espiando una declaración?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Kitamura「Aisaka...... are you really sure?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Aisaka...... ¿estás segura de verdad?」"

msgid "Taiga「I have feelings for......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Siento algo por......」"

msgid "Kitamura「Alright. That's enough.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「De acuerdo. Es suficiente.」"

msgid "Taiga「......!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......!」"

msgid "Kitamura「You don't have to say anything more,＿Aisaka. I understand.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No hace falta que digas nada＿más, Aisaka. Lo entiendo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Kitamura-kun......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Kitamura-kun......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「――In that moment, I...」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「――En ese momento, yo...」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It was like a scene out of a TV drama,＿all fluff and no substance.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Era como una escena de telenovela,＿puro adorno y nada de sustancia.」"

msgid "Taiga「Kitamura... kun...!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Kitamura... kun...!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura, who looked at Taiga as＿though to console her--」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kitamura, mirando a Taiga como＿si quisiera consolarla--」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And Taiga, who looked back up at＿Kitamura with eyes full of trust--」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y Taiga, mirando hacia Kitamura＿con ojos llenos de confianza--」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I sincerely thought they really＿complemented each other――」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sinceramente pensé que de verdad se＿complementaban el uno al otro――」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just take the lunchbox. I won't take no＿for an answer.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Solo toma la caja de almuerzo. No＿aceptaré un no por respuesta.」"

msgid "Taiga「Thank...... you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Gra...... cias.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「My work is done here, so I'm gonna go.＿Sorry for intruding, Kitamura.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya terminé aquí, así que me voy. Perdón＿por interrumpir, Kitamura.」"

msgid "Kitamura「It's fine.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No hay problema.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「See you tomorrow, Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hasta mañana, Taiga.」"

msgid "Taiga「......ji.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......ji.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuuujiii!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Ryuuuujiii!!」"

msgid "Both「......!?」"
msgstr "Ambos「......!?」"

msgid "Taiga「Uh......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eh......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Taiga?」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji...... There's some things you＿have yet to remember.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji...... Hay algunas cosas que＿todavía tienes que recordar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Things I haven't remembered?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cosas que no he recordado?」"

msgid "Taiga「You had a crush on someone, Ryuuji.＿You really, really liked them. But it was＿always one-sided.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Te gustaba alguien, Ryuuji. De verdad＿te gustaba muchísimo. Pero siempre＿fue un amor no correspondido.」"

msgid "Taiga「Your crush probably...... no,＿DEFINITELY liked......」"
msgstr "Taiga「A esa persona quizá...... no,＿DEFINITIVAMENTE le gustaba......」"

msgid "Taiga「Try your best to remember. Then be＿happy with the person you love.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Haz tu mejor esfuerzo por recordar. Y＿luego sé feliz con la persona que amas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Taiga「That's all I wanted to say. Let's go,＿Kitamura-kun.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eso es todo lo que quería decir.＿Vámonos, Kitamura-kun.」"

msgid "Kitamura「But Aisaka--」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Pero Aisaka--」"

msgid "Taiga「Let's go!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Vámonos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And so a few weeks passed......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y así pasaron unas semanas......」"

msgid "Kitamura「Hey, Aisaka.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Oye, Aisaka.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hm～?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Mm～?」"

msgid "Kitamura「I'll check your lunch today. Show me＿everything you bought from the＿convenience store.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Hoy revisaré tu almuerzo. Muéstrame＿todo lo que compraste en la tienda＿de conveniencia.」"

msgid "Taiga「What～? You don't have to do that. I'm＿careful, so it's okay!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué～? No hace falta que hagas eso.＿Tengo cuidado, ¡así que está bien!」"

msgid "Taiga「......Kitamura-kun, you're so naggy.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Kitamura-kun, qué fastidioso eres.」"

msgid "Taiga「W-Wait for me!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡E-Espérame!」"

msgid "Haruta「How nice～ How great～ How sweet～」"
msgstr "Haruta「Qué lindo～ Qué bien～ Qué dulce～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Haruta「Taka-chan, ya listenin'?」"
msgstr "Haruta「Taka-chan, ¿estás escuchando?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nope.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nop.」"

msgid "Noto「Hmmmmmm～～～」"
msgstr "Noto「Mmmmmmmm～～～」"

msgid "Haruta「Notocchi, ya listenin'?」"
msgstr "Haruta「Notocchi, ¿estás escuchando?」"

msgid "Noto「Nope.」"
msgstr "Noto「Nop.」"

msgid "Haruta「You can hear me! You're definitely just＿ignorin' me!」"
msgstr "Haruta「¡Sí me oyes! ¡Seguro solo＿me estás ignorando!」"

msgid "Noto「Something just feels off, man......」"
msgstr "Noto「Algo no cuadra aquí, amigo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Like what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Como qué?」"

msgid "Noto「Kitamura and the Tiger. I mean, I've＿always thought it'd be neat to see＿those two hook up.」"
msgstr "Noto「Kitamura y Tigre. Digo, siempre＿pensé que sería genial ver que＿esos dos salieran juntos.」"

msgid "Noto「Now that they've gone and done it, it's＿not quite what I had in mind, man......」"
msgstr "Noto「Ahora que por fin lo hicieron, no es＿como me lo imaginaba, amigo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「How so?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué lo dices?」"

msgid "Noto「There's not enough love.」"
msgstr "Noto「Falta amor.」"

msgid "Noto「NO I'M NOT! Hmmm, how do I put this?＿See, Kitamura and the Tiger are＿practically......」"
msgstr "Noto「¡NO ES ESO! Mmm, ¿cómo explicarlo?＿Mira, Kitamura y Tigre son＿prácticamente......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's that look supposed to mean?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y esa mirada qué significa?」"

msgid "Noto「Well, I was thinking it's as if you and＿Kitamura switched places, man.」"
msgstr "Noto「Pues pensaba que es como si＿tú y Kitamura hubieran＿cambiado de lugar, amigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Haruta「Huh? Whaddya mean?」"
msgstr "Haruta「¿Eh? ¿Qué quieres decir?」"

msgid "Noto「When you really think about it, the＿problem's down to this: are they＿friends or not? WHICH IS IT!?!」"
msgstr "Noto「Si lo piensas bien, el problema＿se reduce a esto: ¿son amigos＿o no? ¡¿CUÁL DE LAS DOS?!」"

msgid "Noto「Here I thought taming the Tiger was＿something only Takasu could do, ya＿know～」"
msgstr "Noto「Y yo que pensaba que domar＿a Tigre era algo que solo Takasu＿podía hacer, ¿no～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......That's what I thought too.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Yo también pensaba eso.」"

msgid "Noto「Hm? What did you just say? Uh, where＿are you going, Takasu?」"
msgstr "Noto「¿Mm? ¿Qué dijiste? Oye,＿¿adónde vas, Takasu?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「After that showy confession on the＿stairs, Kitamura told me something.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tras esa declaración tan vistosa en las＿escaleras, Kitamura me dijo algo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「When Taiga turned around and＿confessed out of nowhere, Kitamura＿understood her reasoning behind it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cuando Taiga dio media vuelta y se＿declaró de la nada, Kitamura entendió＿sus motivos para hacerlo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Let me clear up any＿misunderstandings, Takasu. Aisaka＿and myself are not dating.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Déjame aclarar cualquier malentendido,＿Takasu. Aisaka y yo no estamos saliendo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What do you mean?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Qué quieres decir?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Aisaka won't find happiness in dating＿me. The person Aisaka loves is＿someone else.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Aisaka no encontrará la felicidad＿saliendo conmigo. La persona＿a la que ama es otra.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura's words hit me point-blank.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Las palabras de Kitamura＿me dieron de lleno.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The one who can understand Taiga the＿best right now isn't me...... It's Kitamura.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Quien mejor puede entender a Taiga ahora＿mismo no soy yo...... Es Kitamura.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura was right after all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kitamura tenía razón después de todo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No one even comes close.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nadie se le acerca siquiera.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What can be done for the dragon who＿no longer belongs?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué se puede hacer por el dragón＿que ya no pertenece aquí?」"

msgid "Yuri「Hello. First of all, perhaps I should＿thank you for your hard work,＿Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Hola. Antes que nada, quizá＿debería agradecerte por tu arduo＿trabajo, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Now that you got this ending, the＿reason I brought you here......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ahora que obtuviste este final, la razón＿por la que te traje aquí......」"

msgid "Yuri「......is none other than to discuss the＿route you chose. I thought we could＿ponder it together.」"
msgstr "Yuri「......no es otra que hablar sobre＿tu ruta. Pensé que podríamos＿reflexionar juntos.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's evaluate the ending you＿just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, evaluemos el final＿que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「Welcome, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bienvenido, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's begin to evaluate the＿ending you just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, empecemos a evaluar el＿final que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「Hmmm～...... I see. This time, Aisaka-san＿wouldn't even look at you anymore.＿What a shame.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Mmm～...... Ya veo. Esta vez,＿Aisaka-san ya ni siquiera quiso＿mirarte. Qué pena.」"

msgid "Yuri「Now then. If I were to grade this＿ending, I guess I'd give it 65 points. I＿want you to try just a little bit harder.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ahora bien. Si tuviera que calificar＿este final, le daría 65 puntos. Quiero＿que te esfuerces un poco más.」"

msgid "Yuri「Okay, that's all for today. Until next＿time!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bueno, eso es todo por hoy.＿¡Hasta la próxima!」"

msgid "『Music』 is now available in 『Extra』"
msgstr "『Música』 ya está disponible en 『Extra』"

msgid "『Album』 is now available in 『Extra』"
msgstr "『Álbum』 ya está disponible en 『Extra』"

msgid "Ryuuji「（This is no time for indecision...... All's＿fair in love and war.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No es momento de dudar...... Todo se＿vale en el amor y en la guerra.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I have no choice but to use my own＿two hands......!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡No me queda más que usar＿mis propias manos......!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry for the wait!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Perdón por la espera!」"

msgid "Taiga「H-Hey, what the hell's with that＿getup!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「O-Oye, ¡¿qué demonios es esa facha?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now, Kitamura, fight me!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ahora, Kitamura, pelea conmigo!」"

msgid "Kitamura「That's the nudist Santa costume......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ese es el disfraz de Santa nudista......」"

msgid "Kitamura「I let you borrow it because I was＿worried about you...... Ngh, you're such＿a coward.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Te lo presté porque estaba preocupado＿por ti...... Agh, eres un cobarde.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, the nudist Santa...... Pffft!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji, el Santa nudista...... ¡Pffft!」"

msgid "Taiga「Bahahaha!! That's SO lame! Your＿raisins are on full display! I, I can't＿breathe. Aahahaha!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Buajajaja!! ¡Qué PATÉTICO! ¡Se＿te ven las pasitas! N-No puedo＿respirar. ¡Ajajajaja!」"

msgid "Kitamura「R-Raisins!?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡¿P-Pasitas?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Now's my chance!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡Es mi oportunidad!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Whoa!!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡¡Uah!!」"

msgid "Taiga「Wha!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Qué?!」"

msgid "Kitamura「W-What are you doing!?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡¿Q-Qué estás haciendo?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, I'm gonna need to borrow＿Kitamura.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga, voy a tener que llevarme＿prestado a Kitamura.」"

msgid "Taiga「Borrow him......? Wait, Ryuuji! Where are＿you going this time!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Llevártelo prestado......? ¡Espera,＿Ryuuji! ¡¿Adónde vas esta vez?!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Wait! What do you plan to do!? Put me＿down!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Espera! ¡¿Qué planeas hacer?! ¡Bájame!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Quit your bitching! You're the one who＿said I should use force!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Deja de quejarte! ¡Tú fuiste quien＿dijo que usara la fuerza!」"

msgid "Kitamura「I meant in a man-to-man fistfight.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Me refería a una pelea a puños＿de hombre a hombre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't care for violence. This is my＿show of force. Got a problem with＿that!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No me gusta la violencia. Esta＿es mi demostración de fuerza.＿¡¿Algún problema con eso?!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Takasu......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Takasu......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「With Kitamura in tow, I just focused on＿running.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cargando con Kitamura, solo＿me concentré en correr.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「All I could think of was to get Taiga＿away from Kitamura as fast as＿possible......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Lo único en que pensaba era en＿alejar a Taiga de Kitamura lo＿más rápido posible......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Pant, wheeze......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Jadeo, resuello......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now you're too far away to do anything＿else.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ahora estás demasiado lejos＿para hacer otra cosa.」"

msgid "Kitamura「......I'm sorry, Takasu.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......Lo siento, Takasu.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I hope you learned your lesson.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Espero que hayas aprendido la lección.」"

msgid "Kitamura「......You were thinking of me all this＿time.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......Estuviste pensando＿en mí todo este tiempo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Kitamura「To think that I, of all people, was so＿close to you, yet totally oblivious of＿your feelings until today.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Pensar que yo, entre todos, estaba＿tan cerca de ti y no me di cuenta＿de tus sentimientos hasta hoy.」"

msgid "Kitamura「I said \"take by force,\" and so you did.＿I'm fiercely impressed.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Dije \"tómalo a la fuerza\", y así lo＿hiciste. Estoy muy impresionado.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait, hang on.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Espera, aguarda.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Slow down, Kitamura. Y-You're too＿close!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Frena, Kitamura. ¡E-Estás＿demasiado cerca!」"

msgid "Kitamura「I've always thought you'd be my type if＿I was a woman...... but I can fall for you＿as a man, right?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Siempre pensé que serías mi tipo si＿yo fuera mujer...... pero puedo＿enamorarme de ti como hombre, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Won't you go out with me, Takasu?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿No quieres salir conmigo, Takasu?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wh...... WHAAAAAAAT!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qu...... ¡¿QUÉÉÉÉÉÉ?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Wait, I DON'T CARE!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡¡Espera, NO ME IMPORTA!!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Ha ha ha! What, have you come to＿reason? Let's keep going and start＿some shenanigans.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Ja, ja, ja! ¿Qué, ya entraste＿en razón? Sigamos adelante y hagamos＿algunas travesuras.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't be stupid. You'll put a dent in my＿healthy high school lifestyle.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No seas tonto. Vas a arruinar mi sana＿vida de estudiante de preparatoria.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, great......! Did I turn that many＿heads!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Genial......! ¡¿Tantas miradas atraje?!」"

